# Never commit the transport credentials.
#
# ac14k_m.pem bundles a PRIVATE KEY. It is publicly known, but vendoring a private
# key into a repo is a bad habit and secret scanners will flag it. Fetch it at
# setup time instead.
ac14k_m.pem
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.key

# The DeviceToken grants full local control of the AC. Config or env only.
DEVICE_TOKEN.txt
*.local
*.local.*
.env
.env.*

# Captured during the token pairing ritual; may contain the token in the clear.
token_capture.log
ac_devices.json

node_modules/
dist/
coverage/
*.log
.DS_Store

# Working notes and hardware findings: local only, by choice. notes/HANDOFF.md
# records how this air conditioner behaves and why the local transport was
# chosen; notes/WRITE-SUPPORT.md is the probe's report on which writes it honours.
# Neither was ever published to npm - package.json "files" excludes them.
notes/
